OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands are without power in the
OL,8,Fcountry's southeast - and Alabama,
OL,9,FFlorida and Georgia have issued states
OL,10,Fof emergency as they brace for heavy
OL,11,Frains and flooding
OL,13,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,14,Fofficials, urging residents to follow
OL,15,Fevacuation orders as the state feels
OL,16,Fthe storm's initial impacts
OL,18,FOne Florida resident tells the BBC that
OL,19,F"everyone's gone", but he's remaining
OL,20,Fin his home, securing his ducks and
OL,21,Fchickens in the bathroom
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
